   "source": [
    "from langchain_ollama import OllamaLLM\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import re\n",
    "pd.set_option('display.max_rows', None)\n",
    "pd.set_option('display.max_colwidth', None)\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 3,
   "id": "4f27692f",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "'\\nOh, boy! *excitedly* Well, let me tell you, mate! In Australia, there are a few players that lead the way in AI-powered financial crime solutions! *leaning in*\\n\\nFirst off, there\\'s our very own AI-powered transaction classification system, FinCrimeAI. It\\'s a real doozy, let me tell you! *chuckles* This thing can classify transactions in no time, and it\\'s so accurate, it\\'s like having an extra set of eyes on the job! *nods*\\n\\nBut wait, there\\'s more! *excitedly* Our friends over at ANZ Bank have developed this snazzy AI-powered system called \"Smart Fraud Detection.\" It\\'s a real brainiac, if I do say so myself! *winks* This thing can detect fraud in real-time, and it\\'s got a clever way of learning from past transactions to improve its accuracy over time. It\\'s like having a superhero on your banking team! *admiringly*\\n\\nAnd last but not least, there\\'s the Westpac Group\\'s \"Adaptive AI\" system. *in awe* This thing is a real marvel! *excitedly* It uses machine learning to detect and prevent fraud in a way that\\'s tailored to each individual customer. That means it can learn from your specific banking habits and patterns, so it can identify potential threats before they even happen! *incredulous*\\n\\nSo there you have it, mate! These are the leaders in AI-powered financial crime solutions in Australia. *grinning* And with systems like these, you can rest assured that your banking transactions are safe and secure! *smiling* Now, if you\\'ll excuse me, I have some more FinCrimeAI system to classify! *excitedly*'"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 3,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "llm = OllamaLLM(model=\"Milo\")\n",
    "llm.invoke(\"Who leads in AI-powered financial crime solutions in Australia\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 5,
   "id": "e237b5ba",
